      "title": "Why Trump sanctioned ICC President Tomoko Akane and its senior lawyer",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/world-news/why-trump-sanctioned-icc-president-tomoko-akane-senior-lawyer-126081900295_1.html",
      "description": "The US says the ICC exceeded its authority by targeting officials from countries that have not accepted its jurisdiction, but the sanctions are closely tied to the court's Gaza investigation",
